WEBVTT

00:14:58.588 --> 00:15:01.180
in work or in life,

00:15:01.180 --> 00:15:03.056
there's a word for what you're going to see:

00:15:03.056 --> 00:15:04.233
the cloud.

00:15:04.233 --> 00:15:05.766
And you can go through the cloud

00:15:05.766 --> 00:15:07.174
not alone but together

00:15:07.174 --> 00:15:09.212
with someone who is your source of support

00:15:09.212 --> 00:15:11.260
to say "Yes, and" to your ideas,

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:13.577
to help you say "Yes, and" to your own ideas,

00:15:13.577 --> 00:15:15.464
to increase the chance that,

00:15:15.464 --> 00:15:17.190
through the wisps of the cloud,

00:15:17.190 --> 00:15:18.688
you'll find that moment of calmness

00:15:18.688 --> 00:15:20.491
where you get your first glimpse

00:15:20.491 --> 00:15:23.741
of your unexpected discovery,

00:15:23.741 --> 00:15:26.465
your C.

00:15:26.465 --> 00:15:28.785
Thank you.

00:15:28.785 --> 00:15:32.785
(Applause)